{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15344200","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15344200","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1534420001:0":{"text":"勇士は見知らぬ森へと足を踏み入れた。そこは樹怒の谷で見慣れた翠緑とは異なり、植物は陰鬱で神秘的な黒を帯びていた。宝はきっとこの先にあるに違いない。","source_cn":"勇士来到了一片陌生的密林。与树怒山谷熟悉的翠绿不同，远...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73B912DE8EEA7C1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1534420002:0":{"text":"しかし、突然の急流が勇士の行く手を阻む。彼女には誰も知らない秘密があった……実は、水が怖いのだ。","source_cn":"但那条湍急的溪流将她拦下。勇士有着不为人知的恐惧：她很怕水。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21C1ECCB00D59A4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1534420003:0":{"text":"しかし宝探しの目的は、恐怖に直面し、勇気を獲得することにある。勇士は手にした剣をしっかり握り、川の中へ足を踏み入れた……","source_cn":"但寻找宝藏，本就是直面恐惧、获得勇气的征途。勇士握紧了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49DCE4647B31E950","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:老兽人暗眼":{"text":"獣人のダルカイ","source":"老兽人暗眼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}